      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div style=&#34;width: 100%; margin: -2rem -2rem 2rem -2rem;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;height: 300px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;&#34;&gt;
    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/about-hero.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Developer workspace with code and creativity&#34; style=&#34;width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;p style=&#34;text-align: right; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #888; margin: 0.5rem 1rem 0 0; font-style: italic;&#34;&gt;
    Photo by &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.vecteezy.com/members/teerawatcr594810&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; style=&#34;color: #888; text-decoration: none;&#34;&gt;Teerawat Wutthikan&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.vecteezy.com/photo/69691106-traveler-photographing-monks-in-ancient-monastery-amidst-mountains&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; style=&#34;color: #888; text-decoration: none;&#34;&gt;Vecteezy&lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;who-i-am&#34;&gt;Who I Am&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m Ioannis, a Computer Science student with a passion for building things and understanding how they break. My journey spans from software development to game design, and more recently to cybersecurity and homelabbing, where my goal is to combine technical problem solving with curiosity about how systems really work.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
