&lt;h2 id=&#34;-what-im-focused-on&#34;&gt;🎯 What I&amp;rsquo;m Focused On&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m doing my MSc in Computer Science and Engineering at DTU with a cybersecurity specialization. My focus is understanding how software fails, and how to build and run systems that hold up.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
